2:["$","div",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_main__yE6rE","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"article_container__mrYyB","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2","className":"article_breadcrumb__QcrjM","children":"An Anthology of Joy and Thought Vol. 2"}],["$","$L9",null,{"className":"article_image__u30Oq","src":"/blog/an-anthology-2/12.jpg","width":600,"height":600,"alt":"article image"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article_credit__oXW7f","children":"Image: Stephen Noh"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"article_title__QnbG_","children":"a prayer of desperation"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_text__aOBg_","children":["Lord, You have broken me ",["$","br",null,{}],"You have shown my weakness ",["$","br",null,{}],"my failures ",["$","br",null,{}],"a glimpse of the depth of my sin ",["$","br",null,{}],"and it has broken me! ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"As this world and what i’ve built seems to crumble down ",["$","br",null,{}],"to think, in the world’s eyes, i have lost so little ",["$","br",null,{}],"Job lost everything ",["$","br",null,{}],"David fled his pursuers to save his life ",["$","br",null,{}],"Elijah had no will to live ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Oh, Lord, in comparison to these men, how little have i lost! ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Yet even in my lack, You have shown me my weakness ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"i have lost things of the world ",["$","br",null,{}],"yet i still feel so broken ",["$","br",null,{}],"How great was my dependence on this world ",["$","br",null,{}],"if losing this little meant so much, how weak i am! ",["$","br",null,{}],"how much more i am in need of You ",["$","br",null,{}],"You have shown my faults ",["$","br",null,{}],"my iniquity ",["$","br",null,{}],"my need for a savior ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"i am weak ",["$","br",null,{}],"i have nothing ",["$","br",null,{}],"i am nothing ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Yet still i can rejoice ",["$","br",null,{}],"Yet still i can praise Your name ",["$","br",null,{}],"Yet still i can say, ",["$","q",null,{"children":"i am free"}]," ",["$","br",null,{}],"Because You cover me ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"For true freedom comes from surrender ",["$","br",null,{}],"and in every step You have shown me Your love ",["$","br",null,{}],"so Lord, continue to grow my desperation ",["$","br",null,{}],"to show me everyday that i need You ",["$","br",null,{}],"for You are all i need ",["$","br",null,{}],"and will You help me never forget that ",["$","br",null,{}],["$","br",null,{}],"Amen ",["$","br",null,{}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article_buttons__11MsX","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/11","className":"article_href__UZeXP","children":"<  Previous"}],["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/blog/an-anthology-2/13","className":"article_href__UZeXP","children":"Next  >"}]]}]]}]}]}]
